2026-07-27T08:44:18.1257522Z i /tmp/RtmpMtjpFo/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:44:18.1257943Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:44:18.1258443Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:44:18.1259233Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:44:18.1259923Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:44:18.1260924Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:44:18.1261739Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
